{title: Quem É Esse?}
{artist: Julliany Souza}
{tempo: 66}
{time: 4/4}

{c: Intro}
[A] [B] [C#m7] [G#m7]

{c: Verse 1}
[A]Eu me deparei
I CAME FACE TO FACE
[B]Com Aquele Mestre escrevendo
WITH THAT MASTER WRITING
[G#m7]Com o dedo no chão
WITH HIS FINGER ON THE GROUND
[C#m7]Ouvindo os fariseus a lhes falar
HEARING THE PHARISEES SPEAK TO THEM
[A]Que a lei de Moisés
THAT THE LAW OF MOSES
[B]Me condenava por meus erros
CONDEMNED ME FOR MY SINS
[G#m7]Mas nenhuma pedra
BUT NOT ONE STONE
[C#m7]Ele pegou pra me apedrejar
DID HE PICK UP TO STONE ME

{c: Pre-Chorus}
[A]Eu só tinha os meus pecados
I ONLY HAD MY SINS
[B]Pra lhe oferecer
TO OFFER HIM
[G#m7]Mas mesmo assim me amou
BUT EVEN SO HE LOVED ME
[C#m7]Mas mesmo assim me amou
BUT EVEN SO HE LOVED ME
[A]Com uma frase, atire a pedra
WITH ONE PHRASE, THROW THE STONE
[B]Quem nunca pecou
WHOEVER HAS NEVER SINNED
[G#m7]Ele me perdoou
HE FORGAVE ME
[C#m7]Ele me perdoou
HE FORGAVE ME
[F#m7]Sua irresistível graça [E/G#]me [A]alcançou
HIS IRRESISTIBLE GRACE REACHED ME

{c: Chorus}
[E]Quem é esse?
WHO IS THIS?
[C#m7]Que era sem pecado e não me condenou
WHO WAS WITHOUT SIN AND DID NOT CONDEMN ME
[A]No lugar da morte, vida me ofertou
IN THE PLACE OF DEATH, OFFERED ME LIFE
[F#m7]O Cordeiro que por mim se [E/B]entregou
THE LAMB WHO GAVE HIMSELF FOR ME
[B]E os meus pecados levou
AND CARRIED AWAY MY SINS

{c: Interlude}
[A] [B] [C#m7] [G#m7]

{c: Bridge 1}
[A]Eu não Te troco por nada
I WOULD NOT TRADE YOU FOR ANYTHING
[B]Não há espaço pra mais nada
THERE IS NO ROOM FOR ANYTHING ELSE
[C#m7]Todo vazio que havia em mim
EVERY EMPTINESS THAT WAS IN ME
[G#m7]Hoje é Sua morada
TODAY IS HIS DWELLING
[A]A minha alma buscava
MY SOUL WAS SEARCHING
[B]E nada me completava
AND NOTHING COMPLETED ME
[G#m7]A Tua presença é o que faltava em mim
YOUR PRESENCE IS WHAT WAS MISSING IN ME
[A]Minha vida foi transformada
MY LIFE WAS TRANSFORMED

